{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Contain undefined JSON serialization results**\n\nFor a top-level function, `Symbol`, or `toJSON()` returning `undefined`, `JSON.stringify` returns `undefined` instead of throwing. That reaches `Buffer.byteLength` on the main thread and terminates the entire shim. Detect an undefined serialization result in the worker and raise a per-invocation function error, then test that a subsequent invocation still succeeds.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM75QHPR","finding_digest":"e469a68ba15d6fd456a6433666ec9967bfa0501171abdb60637d57a303e60c6c","finding_id":"arf_v1_4ru2nc5blvx5ivvgim3gn3ezm6","finding_key":"github/scripts/js_examples/lambda-shim.cjs::sendjson::serialization-error-containment","identity_key":"github/scripts/js_examples/lambda-shim.cjs::sendjson::serialization-error-containment","line":321,"observation_digest":"9a275b3601f7c1bc9ee032df9b74a42a367c1f804aaf3c20d1d3ac974d454552","observation_id":"aro_v1_titvwnqb67a3zhxaglpzw5fefi","path":".github/scripts/js_examples/lambda-shim.cjs","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_4ru2nc5blvx5ivvgim3gn3ezm6","published_at":"2026-10-05T07:49:48Z","review_id":"arr_v1_lsjtv47drrinlxltegbpdkzd5v","reviewed_base_sha":"631b78d1b505b157eee758662291fc5e2353bbb6","reviewed_head_sha":"64135ddf7c7a779190dcc96159d210359736d153","reviewer":"codex","start_line":321,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":745},"record_id":"art_v1_ogsdlj3a6n7xgjc6mpxy6heivp","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-05T07:49:48Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
